{"steam_appid":821250,"steam_name":"Flotsam","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/821250/1578398391/4115c5944dbbf8fea3ba7fedbda8bf41eaf92ddd/1764864669/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764866098","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257243651/628f5f97294a4e20e3c4a6b19401e76c337c5016/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764866098","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/dcd20c1396852c32145f889e2993a8fdecd70779/ss_dcd20c1396852c32145f889e2993a8fdecd70779.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782735785","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/06c9d106fbc9989bf44237d73d8c3083d83a098f/ss_06c9d106fbc9989bf44237d73d8c3083d83a098f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782735785","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/a908e44b14f858670a9f940c3fd87305c6c0cece/ss_a908e44b14f858670a9f940c3fd87305c6c0cece.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782735785","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/0d650bb1185cc237ecb304bd3cf5db757d3af419/ss_0d650bb1185cc237ecb304bd3cf5db757d3af419.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782735785","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/3d682bc031cdc49536bc22a2bed09e7cca2abda4/ss_3d682bc031cdc49536bc22a2bed09e7cca2abda4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1782735785"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/16a766d4edc058f6fb2089fc4cb2cf79.avif?t=1782735785\" width=1560 height=1040 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/f904662d84bb574f156df9c13b1542d9.avif?t=1782735785\" width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn ocean garbage into homes, workshops and colorful little gardens.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect floating plastic and driftwood, salvage scraps of the old world, and recycle them into homes that stay afloat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desalinate water, gut fish and board up a shelter to keep everyone safe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your town with plants, refurbished furniture and statues that keep your drifters happy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/ff960b0b49b44e4273941d60295a2607.poster.avif?t=1782735785\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/ff960b0b49b44e4273941d60295a2607.webm?t=1782735785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/ff960b0b49b44e4273941d60295a2607.mp4?t=1782735785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/8a21d353442f727541b7ebc96dc278e9.avif?t=1782735785\" width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set sail to explore the flooded world, from soaked ruins to forgotten islands, and discover what still floats beyond the horizon.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore flooded remnants of the old world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue stranded survivors and friendly animals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Re-discover old technology to improve your town. But be careful your drifters don’t get sick. The old world is polluted!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/d353babc5ad5d67ca357390bd127c707.poster.avif?t=1782735785\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/d353babc5ad5d67ca357390bd127c707.webm?t=1782735785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/d353babc5ad5d67ca357390bd127c707.mp4?t=1782735785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/5dd537caa53686aa9973a1c13fb7ad08.avif?t=1782735785\" width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your drifters each have their own stories to tell. Recruit specialists who unlock new buildings, quests, and discoveries for your floating community.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find unique drifters like the Birdkeeper, Chemist, and Electrician</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new technologies and story quests through their expertise</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete personal storylines to unlock new mechanics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/92b7931433b3c0efbb11afe482c167d7.poster.avif?t=1782735785\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/92b7931433b3c0efbb11afe482c167d7.webm?t=1782735785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/92b7931433b3c0efbb11afe482c167d7.mp4?t=1782735785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/23732757365750783c6be85d74ec0118.avif?t=1782735785\" width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop cleaner, smarter systems that turn waste into progress and keep your floating town thriving in this feel-good apocalypse.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research new tech to transition from burning firewood to green eel-ectricity generation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build connected production pipelines that turn your floating town into a self-sustaining ecosystem.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean food and develop cures for pollution-born diseases and keep your drifters healthy and productive</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/b11350a3b456d767590fba7f0c880f5a.poster.avif?t=1782735785\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/b11350a3b456d767590fba7f0c880f5a.webm?t=1782735785\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821250/extras/b11350a3b456d767590fba7f0c880f5a.mp4?t=1782735785\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 SP1+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 650 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 600 MB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Indie","Simulation","Strategy"],"developers":["Pajama Llama Games"],"publishers":["Stray Fawn Publishing"],"release_date":"4 Dec, 2025"}